<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="./images/favicon.ico">
  <title>DGS Creative Arbitrum NFT Mint</title>
  <meta name="author" content="David G. Smith">
  <meta name="description" content="A personal NFT mint on Arbitrum.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jura&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    integrity="sha384-rbsA2VBKQhggwzxH7pPCaAqO46MgnOM80zW1RWuH61DGLwZJEdK2Kadq2F9CUG65" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="bhf-light">
  <!-- Header area -->
  <%- include('header'); %>
  <main>
    <!-- Splash area -->
    <section id="splash">
      <div class="container-fluid">
        <div>
          <div class="spacer"></div>
          <div id="hero-text" class="text-center">
            <h1 class="display-5 display-md-3">David G. Smith, visual artist</h1>
            <p>Eclectic Art NFTs on the Arbitrum One network</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- Projects area -->
    <section id="projects-area">
      <div class="container-fluid border-bottom">
        <div>
          <div class="spacer"></div>
          <div id="contracts" class="d-none"><%= contracts %></div>
          <div id="mints" class="d-none"><%= mints %></div>
          <div id="projects" class="d-none"><%= JSON.stringify(projects) %></div>
          <h1 class="display-5 justify-content-center text-center">Projects</h1>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
              <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-3 text-center justify-content-center">
                <% projects.forEach((item, index) => {%>
                <div id="project-holder" class="col-10">
                  <% let link ="/project/"+item.id %>
                  <%- include('projectCard', {image: item.img_url, name: item.project_name, ident: item.id, link: link}); %>
                </div>
                <% }); %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- Artist / Contact area -->
    <section id="artist" class="m-3 border-bottom">
      <div class="container col-xl-10 col-xxl-8 px-4 py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center g-lg-5 py-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 justify-content-center mb-5">
            <div>
              <div id="artist-face" class="m-2">
                <img class="me-2 border rounded-3" src="./images/davidGailSmith.png" role="img" alt="artist image">
              </div>
              <div id="artist-text">
                <p class="m-2 fs-4 text-center"><strong>Artist David Gail Smith</strong></p>
                <p class="m-2 text-center"><em>BRIDGING TRADITIONAL WITH FUTURISTIC</em></p>
                <p class="m-2">I am a visual artist currently based in Dallas, Texas.

                  I began writing code as a teen on a TI-99/4a and later an Apple //c until leaving home for college in
                  the
                  late 80s. Fast-forward three decades. After retiring in 2014 from 21-year military aviation career, I
                  now
                  endeavor to rediscover the “energy of wonder” I possessed as a young man before the military.
                  Post-military, I completed 2 degrees: a BFA in Studio Art and a BA in Creative Computation. Originally
                  from
                  Erie, Pennsylvania, I moved across the U.S. several times while growing up and served nearly half of
                  my
                  military career overseas. My world travels, exposure to many cultures, and life experiences have given
                  me
                  a unique perspective.

                  My work experiments across media, involving emotional introspection of my experiences and shared
                  influences with others in our world. I am on an eternal quest for themes that bind people, share
                  cultures,
                  and celebrate humanity in pursuit of what is universal and simply put – beautiful and interesting. I
                  seek
                  to defy stereotypes, transcend divisive and useless social and political assumptions, and connect with
                  anyone in search of common ground. With one foot in fine arts and another in computers, I strive to
                  combine art with technology, the traditional with the cutting-edge, and the ancient with the
                  futuristic,
                  in search of an art that is the hybrid of historical tradition and future technology.
                </p>
                <p class="text-center"><a class="text-dark" href="./images/DGScv.pdf" target="blank"><strong>Open CV (in
                      new
                      tab)</strong></a></p>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>




          <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto col-lg-6">
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold lh-1 mb-3">Question? Comment? Reach out here.
            </h2>
            <p class="fs-4 mb-4">I will return your message as soon as I am able. Thank you.</p>
            <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form-light p-4 p-md-5 border rounded-3">
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="floatingFirst" required>
                <label class="text-dark fs-3" for="floatingFirst"><strong>First Name</strong></label>
              </div>
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="floatingLast" required>
                <label class="text-dark fs-3" for="floatingLast"><strong>Last Name</strong></label>
              </div>
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input type="email" class="form-control" id="floatingEmail" required>
                <label class="text-dark fs-3" for="floatingEmail"><strong>Email address</strong></label>
              </div>
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" size="7" maxlength="1000" id="floatingMessage" required>
                <label class="text-dark fs-3" for="floatingMessage"><strong>Message</strong></label>
              </div>
              <button id="send-contact" class="w-100 buttons-light btn btn-outline-light" type="submit">Reach
                out</button>
              <div id="contact-button-response"></div>
              <hr class="my-4">
              <div class="text-center justify-content-evenly">
                <svg id="handshake" class="logo-light me-1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 512"
                  height="50"
                  fill="#000000"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.3.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. -->
                  <path
                    d="M534 248v3.3l69.7-69.7c21.9-21.9 21.9-57.3 0-79.2L525.6 24.4c-21.9-21.9-57.3-21.9-79.2 0L406.3 64.5c-2.7-.3-5.5-.5-8.3-.5H286c-37.1 0-67.6 28-71.6 64H214V248c0 22.1 17.9 40 40 40s40-17.9 40-40V176c0 0 0-.1 0-.1V160l16 0 136 0c0 0 0 0 .1 0H454c44.2 0 80 35.8 80 80v8zM326 192v56c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72V129.4c-35.9 6.2-65.8 32.3-76 68.2L89.5 255.2 16.3 328.4c-21.9 21.9-21.9 57.3 0 79.2l78.1 78.1c21.9 21.9 57.3 21.9 79.2 0l37.7-37.7c.9 0 1.8 .1 2.7 .1H374c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48c0-5.6-1-11-2.7-16H422c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48c0-12.8-5-24.4-13.2-33c25.7-5 45.1-27.6 45.2-54.8v-.4c-.1-30.8-25.1-55.8-56-55.8c0 0 0 0 0 0l-120 0z" />
                </svg>
                <small><em>Your data is never shared.</em></small>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <!-- Footer area -->
  <%- include('footer'); %>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
    integrity="sha384-kenU1KFdBIe4zVF0s0G1M5b4hcpxyD9F7jL+jjXkk+Q2h455rYXK/7HAuoJl+0I4"
    crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  <script type="module" src="./js/index.js"></script>
</body>

</html>